{
  "uid": "juniper-overview",
  "title": "Juniper Overview",
  "description": "Cross-service overview for the Juniper platform",
  "tags": ["juniper", "overview"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "interval",
        "type": "interval",
        "query": "1m,5m,10m,30m,1h",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "5m",
          "value": "5m"
        },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Service Status",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "JuniperData",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "up{job=\"juniper-data\"}",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "UP", "color": "green" } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "JuniperCascor",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "up{job=\"juniper-cascor\"}",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "UP", "color": "green" } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "JuniperCanopy",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "up{job=\"juniper-canopy\"}",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "UP", "color": "green" } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Request Rate",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request Rate (per second)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(juniper_data_http_requests_total[$interval])",
          "legendFormat": "juniper-data {{method}} {{endpoint}} {{status}}"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(juniper_cascor_http_requests_total[$interval])",
          "legendFormat": "juniper-cascor {{method}} {{endpoint}} {{status}}"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(juniper_canopy_http_requests_total[$interval])",
          "legendFormat": "juniper-canopy {{method}} {{endpoint}} {{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Error Rate",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Error Rate (%)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(juniper_data_http_requests_total{status=~\"4..|5..\"}[$interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(juniper_data_http_requests_total[$interval])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "juniper-data"
        },
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(juniper_cascor_http_requests_total{status=~\"4..|5..\"}[$interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(juniper_cascor_http_requests_total[$interval])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "juniper-cascor"
        },
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(juniper_canopy_http_requests_total{status=~\"4..|5..\"}[$interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(juniper_canopy_http_requests_total[$interval])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "juniper-canopy"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Latency",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 23 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request Latency — p50 / p95 / p99",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(juniper_data_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$interval])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "juniper-data p50"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(juniper_data_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$interval])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "juniper-data p95"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(juniper_data_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$interval])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "juniper-data p99"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(juniper_cascor_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$interval])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "juniper-cascor p50"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(juniper_cascor_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$interval])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "juniper-cascor p95"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(juniper_cascor_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$interval])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "juniper-cascor p99"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(juniper_canopy_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$interval])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "juniper-canopy p50"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(juniper_canopy_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$interval])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "juniper-canopy p95"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(juniper_canopy_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$interval])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "juniper-canopy p99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Cross-Cutting KPIs (R4)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 32 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Canopy Data-Client Error Rate (R4.3)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 33 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(juniper_canopy_data_client_requests_total{status_class=~\"4xx|5xx|transport_error\"}[$interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(juniper_canopy_data_client_requests_total[$interval])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Juniper-Data Cache Miss Ratio (R4.5)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 33 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(juniper_data_dataset_post_total{cache=\"miss\"}[$interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(juniper_data_dataset_post_total[$interval])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 50 },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 80 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Pending R4.4 — worker heartbeat Prometheus bridge",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 37 },
      "collapsed": true,
      "panels": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "title": "Cascor worker GPU saturation (Prometheus bridge pending)",
          "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 38 },
          "options": {
            "mode": "markdown",
            "content": "**Status:** placeholder — the cross-cutting tile for `max(juniper_cascor_worker_gpu_utilization_pct)` (and the related `last_task_duration_seconds` / `recent_task_durations_seconds` aggregations) cannot be drawn yet because the worker heartbeat fields are exposed only as JSON on `/v1/workers`, not on Prometheus `/metrics`.\n\n**Verified on `origin/main` of juniper-cascor:**\n- Heartbeat fields defined: `juniper-cascor/src/api/workers/registry.py:60-62`.\n- JSON exposure: `juniper-cascor/src/api/workers/routes.py:55-57`.\n- No Prometheus `Gauge` / `Histogram` instantiation under `juniper-cascor/src/api/workers/`.\n\n**Planned tile** (after the bridge ships):\n```\nmax(juniper_cascor_worker_gpu_utilization_pct)\n```\n\n**Tracking:** see the `Pending R4.4 — worker heartbeat Prometheus bridge` row on the JuniperCascor dashboard for the bridge entry point. New sub-track candidate: `R5.x` or Phase-6 follow-up."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 3
}
